(A) symbolic algebra
  A1 division: (rhs - lhs)*2/2^m - [R - H + 2(I+delta+S+E+kappa+1)/2^m - Dbar] = 0
  A2 (i): (g+eps)/(c-tau) - (G+2^m eps)/(a-1) = 0;  (ii) left: (cg+tau eps)/(c-tau) - (aG+2^m eps)/((a-1)2^m) = 0
     Phi: (G/2^m + c l0) - Delta(c) = ell0/2**m  (= tau*l0 >= 0)
  A3 proof bound - [c l0 + 2a/(a-1) G/2^m + 2(E+kappa)/2^m + (a+1)/(a-1) eps] = 0
     stated - exact form = 2**(1 - m)*(E + kappa)/(a - 1)  (>= 0 for a > 1, E + kappa >= 0)
  A4 threshold with ceil L = 2^m H + 1: H/(2^m H + 1 + a_rho + kappa) - lower bound = 0  (and H/(ceil L + ...) only grows as ceil L decreases)
  A5 cell count: [(logY-H)(2^m H+1+a+k)/(H(logY-H)) - (l0-lu)/(logY-H)] - [2^m - ((l0-lu)/(logY-H) - (a+1+k)/H)] = 0
  A5 random: 100,000 draws, windows that violate the stated necessary condition: 0

(B) type-class bounds
  min(L - (2^m H - |Sigma| log(2^m+1))) = 1.5850 (>= 0);  max(L - 2^m H) = 0.00e+00 (<= 0)

(C) the best predictor's divergence from the person in the feature case
  300 random feature-case instances: max |E_x D_half(nu_H||P*) - H(rho)| = 1.33e-15

