(E) the cell count example
  l0 = 1e6, H = 1/2, |Y| = 2, l(pi_u) = 0, kappa = 0: min over m <= 200 of the required 2^m = 1.999157e+06 (> 1.99e6: True)
  H(rho) = 1/2 exactly is not attainable with rho(b) 2^m integer (it would need rho = (1/2, 1/2)): at m = 21 the closest is p = 230745/2^21, H = 0.499999776
